- Rate limiting.
- Token and cost tracking.
- Safe fallback messages.
- Request logging that avoids storing unnecessary sensitive information.

If the AI provider fails, explain that the tutor is temporarily unavailable and allow supported pre-authored lessons and questions to continue working.

Never expose the AI API key to the browser.

